🟠 Volume claim pgdata in inventory (prod-eu-1) is failing: storage is over 95% used. It is at 98% of 20 GiB, and it is used by postgres and reporter. postgres fails with "PANIC:  could not write to file "pg_wal/xlogtemp.31": No space left on device". Affected: postgres. Fix: raise the storage request of persistentvolumeclaim/pgdata above 20Gi.
Related alerts: 1 crash loop
To check the size and capacity of the full volume claim, run kubectl describe pvc pgdata -n inventory
